      "source_text": "asset samplingPalettes {\n size 32x24 variants 3\n output point checks output point direction output point samples output point normalized output point state\n draw {\n  values = sampler(10 to 15).pick(3)\n  material = #343a42 to #d8dce2 with gaussian(0.5,0.18)\n  direction = {3,2} to {26,2} with beta(2,3)\n  normalized = {0.0 to 1.0 with gaussian(0.5,0.18),0}\n  checks = {3,40}\n  samples = {values[0],values[2]}\n  for i in 0..3 { rect(2,2+i*6,values[i],4,material) }\n  state = {seed&65535,seed>>16}\n }\n}\n"
